Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Kaleo Designer|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Condition Node Edit Name And Desciption And Delete Via View Tab
Priority: 3
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Kaleo Designer|
	When KaleoDesigner add New Definition Via KDCP
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|New Workflow Definition Title|
	And KaleoDesigner add Node Via View Tab
		|nodeDescription|Condition Node Description|
		|nodeName|Condition|
		|nodeNodeLabel|Condition|
		|nodeType|condition|
	And KaleoDesigner view Node Type
		|nodeNodeLabel|Condition|
		|nodeType|condition|
	Then KaleoDesigner delete Node
		|nodeNodeLabel|Condition|
